#question(title: [Coffee])[
  A coffee filter is shaped like an inverted
  cone. It has a radius at the top of $4 c m$
  and it is $6 c m$ in height. Coffee flows
  out of at the bottom at a rate of
  $2 c m^3 \/ s$. If the filter begins
  completely filled, how fast is the coffee
  level decreasing after 30 seconds?
]
